abstract: >-
  A namespaced, not-peer-reviewed synthetic methods module for typed
  observation and certificate layers. It repairs a channel/POVM observation
  equation, exposes declared sector equivalence classes, and evaluates a
  frozen four-generator benchmark. Dark-matter interpretations are explicitly
  proposed only; the module is not an empirical dark-matter result or a
  validation of SPPT/ASTRA planetary claims. Original code, scripts, tests,
  and schemas are MIT; original documentation, diagrams, synthetic data, and
  generated results are CC BY 4.0 to the extent the author holds the relevant
  rights. Third-party works retain their own terms, and ChatGPT/OpenAI
  assistance is provenance rather than authorship or endorsement.
